---
import ChipButton from "./ChipButton.astro"
---

<div id="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>
      Hey, I'm <span class="my-name">Mish</span>
    </h1>
  </section>
  <main class="content">
    <p>
      I'm a programmer, OpenStreetMap enthusiast, and aviation geek. Nice to
      meet you :)
    </p>
    <p>
      I tend to go by <span class="my-name">MMK21</span> (or <span
        class="my-name">MMK21Hub</span
      >) online.
    </p>
    <h2>Activities</h2>
    <p>
      I currently work at <a href="https://hackclub.com/">Hack Club</a>, helping
      run events like the <a href="https://stardance.hackclub.com/"
        >Stardance Challenge</a
      > for lots of teenage builders.
    </p>
    <p>
      When I'm not coding, I'm messing with my mini PCs and going on night
      walks.
    </p>
    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <p>
      You can find (nearly) everything I've worked on on <a
        href="https://github.com/MMK21Hub">my GitHub page</a
      >. Some highlights are:
      <ul>
        <!-- <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/hackclub/nephthys">hackclub/nephthys</a> &ndash;
          Fully-featured support channel bot made for Hack Club
        </li> -->
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/RandomSearch18/rusty_man_computer"
            >Rusty-Man Computer</a
          > &ndash; Little-Man Computer (LMC) emulator and assembler written in Rust
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/MMK21Hub/C">C</a> &ndash; Esoteric programming
          language that bears no resemblance to any similarly-named serious languages.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Links</h2>
      <div class="links">
        <ChipButton as="a" href="https://github.com/MMK21Hub">GitHub</ChipButton
        >
        <ChipButton as="a" href="https://blog.slevel.xyz">My blog</ChipButton>
      </div>
    </p>
  </main>

  <style></style>

  <script>
    // const $ = document.querySelector.bind(document)
    // function $$<T extends Element = HTMLElement>(selector: string) {
    //   return document.querySelectorAll<T>(selector)
    // }
  </script>

  <style>
    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0;
    }

    h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-heading);
      font-weight: 500;
      margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
      margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    .hero,
    .content {
      margin-inline: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    .hero {
      margin-block: var(--spacing-lg);
    }

    p {
      margin-block: var(--spacing-md);
    }

    a:hover {
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px 0px hsl(var(--color-accent-hsl) / 0.25);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    a:active,
    a:focus {
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px 0px hsl(var(--color-accent-hsl) / 0.5);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .my-name {
      color: hsl(var(--color-accent-300));
    }

    .links {
      display: flex;
      gap: var(--spacing-sm);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  </style>
</div>
